      "text": "EXCLUSIVE: An illegal immigrant hit an ICE officer with his car during a traffic stop in Florida, ‘Nearly Crushing Him’, @DHSgov tells me.\n\nHenry Isaul Garcia reversed his car — which was carrying three other illegal immigrants — into the ICE officer’s leg before “nearly crushing him.\"\n\nThe Guatemalan citizen then hit multiple ICE vehicles during the traffic stop in Homestead, Florida, before speeding off and colliding with a black utility van.\n\nGarcia and his illegal immigrant passengers then ran out of the car, but were ultimately nabbed by the feds.\n\nAssistant Homeland Security Secretary @TriciaOhio tells me “sanctuary politicians” who “have openly encouraged and provided tips for how to evade our ICE officers” are to blame for the latest attack.",
